    "title": "Caleigh Parker honored with Christmas lights and cash - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Trey Stafford ,\n10 hours ago Jonesboro, AR – (JonesboroRightNow.com) – Caleigh Parker knew something was up as soon as she rounded the corner headed home Tuesday evening. There were people and vehicles standing in the middle of Cypress Springs where she lives. Why were they there? Caleigh was being honored as the winner of the 7th annual Light Up Their Hearts promotion presented by Ground Crew, LLC, Fat City Steak and Grillhouse, 104.9 The Fox and Mix 106.3 radio stations from the Jonesboro Media Group. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 2",
